    "failure_scenario": "func f(ag agent.Agent) { type hooks interface{ InstallHooks(context.Context, bool) (int, error) }; h, _ := ag.(hooks) }. reach() takes the *ast.Ident case and calls reachDecls(file.dir, \"hooks\"), finds nothing, and the guard passes. The DeclaredCaps Hooks gate is bypassed for external agents."
