    "failure_scenario": "type capOf[T any] interface{ ListModels(context.Context) ([]agent.ModelInfo, error) } followed by ag.(capOf[int]) falls through the switch to the not-found return. Likewise, `import . \".../agent/external\"` makes newSourceFile store the key \".\", so an unqualified ident naming a type from that package is looked up in the wrong directory and never found."
